<title>USA: US Defense Stockpile rejects chromite bids.</title>
<headline>US Defense Stockpile rejects chromite bids.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center said it made no award for metallurgical grade chromite ore under the March 11 tender.</p>
<p>Chromite is being offered for sale on the second Tuesday of each month and the next monthly tender will be on April 8.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk, +1-212-859-1640.</p>
</text>
